{"id":283387455,"title":"3.装饰器","summary":"1.简介2.类装饰器我们刚刚打开文件要初始化一下，然后打开下面那个。","content":"<h1>1.简介</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788359090941-907de6d3-ea0c-48f0-9f98-9b06fcbf3d83.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>2.类装饰器</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788359194725-774b0bf6-dd7a-469b-b285-a39dddce5c76.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们刚刚打开文件要初始化一下，然后打开下面那个。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788359249273-fc5795a1-31e3-47d2-816e-8bbfa1eac146.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788359273361-bad362a6-9556-4f10-bbd4-e143e15bdf5e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788359310752-ea3acfa9-9a8c-4c77-b9f9-9cd2cd3fd560.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788359435503-70a291a2-74f7-4c2c-88bf-e932b61d5342.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>会把类打印出来</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788359623895-b2b0e2ba-df5b-4a74-a259-0d2ed8400aa1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788360071020-88f6d659-b342-4c3e-a3f1-2b3c593fda1c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>要是取消了第7行的内容，就会变为我们看不懂的样子了。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788360806490-56cd1317-111e-4852-a39a-b801e6c43482.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>他是不允许我们随便加扩展的。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788360833745-fc2b679a-f886-4007-919f-5cb90534e070.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788360846182-a95919d3-23c9-444b-9c91-4326532c64a0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788360852421-033362d9-e46f-4ba5-84b6-62d6542e75d3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>如果我们的装饰器返回一个类，返回的类就会替换红色那个函数<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788360984954-3ec8b032-7bca-470c-940d-c2c47edacc30.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788361002873-8b91eaec-c0a2-4e18-9ed8-9459bc588beb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788361121229-65beb6bc-90eb-459e-b9f4-18aa9cdd408a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们得有一个静态类型的类，叫wife。图一是不具备这个类的</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788361237440-0f7f4aaa-3b03-4ec4-978c-d0b3a1013036.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788361193944-b3739065-9062-4253-a0c0-b34a738a8274.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788361285903-76081e52-2976-4a14-a737-c9be2a2b988a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788361297466-42baa51f-cb03-4a0e-9a49-5e3d1dd797e1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788361635682-9f675a06-c0dc-4145-8b40-261e4e70b000.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>3.装饰器工厂<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788438777430-57d17416-be69-47d2-9d61-770844a212e2.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788439602667-13f73217-096f-48f0-8466-6ee5ac61be65.png\" alt=\"\"></h1>\n<p>绿色框的简写形式是红色框的<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788439031796-9e5b4ba6-4843-4436-a3c7-21cc0afb45c8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788439530938-3c608247-4f0f-462a-9667-20ec1ed32259.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>4.简介</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788439619711-035f99df-b6ba-4f01-bf4f-999a2544f480.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788439830272-6e327e94-eea7-4cfa-a62f-d61bfab48522.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788440086999-c1ffd140-e851-4c72-a021-492d9ce92474.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788440040703-5d815ac7-c1e2-4498-954e-b0dcbc5bace8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788440121205-5ac28b0d-174a-48c3-9c5c-4ab920f8577e.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788440128857-561ee9f5-3840-42d0-ae75-f726594a68aa.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>5.属性装饰器</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788440867206-c74d8f72-d197-4a8c-b077-569fc2c87361.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788440852920-2c99e3d4-2a78-4c6e-85b8-16b6b5a3d424.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>绿色的是原型对象，红色的是属性装饰器装饰的属性的名字</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788440842170-229f1e06-deeb-4503-a11a-ba4cb5df8a8d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788440961234-ee53d8d7-b2f0-4daa-b18f-91c2bf52d58f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>属性遮蔽的问题<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788441105920-d40d8f5c-140c-4ae7-a3e1-0ad1dd7e952c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788441192174-67b29b89-971c-4551-983b-e520a55b220e.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788441202175-6cdcff90-99d3-4304-a598-9f9ab28c5bca.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788442053078-3ceb411c-8cf6-4fab-b471-bc714c43b3b9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788442044086-8b5152da-804c-445e-841a-ee9b0e1b934b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>6.方法装饰器</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788442122518-c85608e8-3e65-4a96-bcf3-364d13e45ccf.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788442322626-9474dbe1-8c9a-4d34-9aac-b18d4fe262ea.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788442362663-392cd319-3de1-4fec-b52f-763b780c184e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788442373140-f789bb61-78d9-463d-8bb6-3305c8c26a5f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788442385896-46eed28e-0563-4aa7-a15b-d7a9ae266670.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788442552545-bf564f05-03a3-4457-8c02-2e612df73ec8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>7.访问装饰器</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788442633166-4eb03c36-090f-4625-b564-6bdceb70d6f9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788442729785-d169cedf-4d0b-47c9-813b-2d8e35874fca.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788442738283-508da315-ce01-4c1b-bba2-c5a3fbdfe61c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>8.参数装饰器</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788442910182-f9ab3913-f42c-4819-a75f-28ee5f124d8a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":82975999,"category":{"id":82975999,"name":"Ts","description":""},"created_at":"2026-08-31T14:14:22.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T15:55:54.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/hvdltf/fovuir12m8ni9g46","slug":"fovuir12m8ni9g46","wordCount":212}